      "parameters": {
        "width": 440,
        "height": 752,
        "content": "## LINE AI assistant: reply to customer messages with Gemini\n\n### How it works\nThis turns a LINE Official Account into an AI assistant. When a customer sends a message, LINE calls this webhook. A Code node extracts the text and the reply token, and if it is a text message a Basic LLM Chain with Google Gemini writes a helpful reply in the customer's own language, staying in character for your brand and gracefully deferring on details it cannot know. The reply is sent straight back through the LINE Messaging API using the reply token, and the whole conversation is logged to Google Sheets so you can review what customers ask. Non-text messages (stickers, images) are ignored so the bot never sends an empty reply.\n\n### Setup\n1. Connect Google Gemini (PaLM) API and Google Sheets, and add a Header Auth credential holding your LINE channel access token (Authorization: Bearer ...).\n2. Activate the workflow and set the webhook URL as your LINE channel webhook.\n3. In Set Bot Persona, describe your brand and tone.\n\n### Customization tips\nAdd a Google Sheets FAQ lookup for grounded answers, or hand off to a human on certain keywords."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a29a08f6-78a0-4ee0-9593-47f6b7e1b205",
      "name": "S1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
